<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27022" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίκτῠον</span></b> , τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δικεῖν</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
			<i>net:</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>fishing-net,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δικτύῳ ἐξέρυσαν πολυωπῷ</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰχθύας</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				22.386
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φελλοὶ δ᾽ ὣς ἄγουσι δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					506
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μολυβδὶς ὥστε δ. κατέσπασεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					840
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. καθιέναι, ἀναιρεῖσθαι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				533b19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				602b8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>hunting-net,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.123
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				1083
			</span></i>, etc.; larger than <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρκυς,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				2.5
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				5.26
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				27
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ἄτης, Ἅιδου,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				1078
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1115
			</span></i> (lyr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				932
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>lattice-work,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				11(2).165.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				13
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<i>bottom of a sieve,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
